EX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a subspace because it's closed under addition and scalar multiplication.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III only.\"   </p>\n</div></div>",
